OL,3,GNEWSACandlelight vigil for father
OL,4,Akilled in Lidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community will come together for a
OL,7,Fcandlelight vigil in memory of a father
OL,8,Fof two killed when a car crashed into
OL,9,Fthe entrance of a Lidl supermarket.
OL,11,FJames Singh Jagpal, 39, was pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene in Finchfield Hill,
OL,13,FWolverhampton, on 23 October.
OL,15,FThe vigil will take place at the
OL,16,FWindmill Community Church, next door to
OL,17,Fthe supermarket, on Friday at 18:00
OL,18,FGMT.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
