OL,3,GNEWSACandlelight vigil for father
OL,4,Akilled in Lidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on Facebook, the church
OL,7,Fwrote: "Following the tragic incident
OL,8,Fat Lidl in Finchfield, our thoughts and
OL,9,Fprayers are very much with the family
OL,10,Fand friends of James Singh Jagpal, and
OL,11,Feveryone affected by this heartbreaking
OL,12,Ftragedy."
